{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01BDc7qBSx9s7VbDJKaSH3k3","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Nimbus University Hostel Rules (mock document)\n2\t\n3\t_Mock content written for Assignment 8. It is not a real university's policy._\n4\t\n5\t1. **In-time:** Residents must be inside the hostel by 22:00 on weekdays and 23:00 on Saturdays.\n6\t   Late entry needs a gate pass approved by the warden.\n7\t2. **Visitors:** Visitors are allowed in the ground-floor lounge from 10:00 to 19:00 only, and must sign the register.\n8\t3. **Quiet hours:** 23:00 to 06:00. No music without headphones.\n9\t4. **Appliances:** Electric kettles and irons only. Heaters, induction cooktops and extension boards above 6 A are not allowed.\n10\t5. **Mess:** Breakfast 07:30–09:00, lunch 12:30–14:00, dinner 19:30–21:30. Mess leave needs 24 hours' notice.\n11\t6. **Room changes:** Apply to the warden's office in the first two weeks of a semester.\n12\t7. **Ragging:** Zero tolerance. Report incidents to the anti-ragging helpline or the warden immediately.\n13\t8. **Damage:** Residents pay for damage to hostel property in their room.\n14\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f4efb1a4-fd34-4205-83c0-87c4c23b6e92","uuid":"c356a11e-8536-46b1-962e-e1f94f48e417","timestamp":"2026-11-18T08:42:57.848Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/private/var/folders/cm/_69qrmd57sz5vxgbksyylrb00000gn/T/tmp0xb0skes/campus-helpdesk/mcp-server/data/hostel_rules.md","content":"# Nimbus University Hostel Rules (mock document)\n\n_Mock content written for Assignment 8. It is not a real university's policy._\n\n1. **In-time:** Residents must be inside the hostel by 22:00 on weekdays and 23:00 on Saturdays.\n   Late entry needs a gate pass approved by the warden.\n2. **Visitors:** Visitors are allowed in the ground-floor lounge from 10:00 to 19:00 only, and must sign the register.\n3. **Quiet hours:** 23:00 to 06:00. No music without headphones.\n4. **Appliances:** Electric kettles and irons only. Heaters, induction cooktops and extension boards above 6 A are not allowed.\n5. **Mess:** Breakfast 07:30–09:00, lunch 12:30–14:00, dinner 19:30–21:30. Mess leave needs 24 hours' notice.\n6. **Room changes:** Apply to the warden's office in the first two weeks of a semester.\n7. **Ragging:** Zero tolerance. Report incidents to the anti-ragging helpline or the warden immediately.\n8. **Damage:** Residents pay for damage to hostel property in their room.\n","numLines":14,"startLine":1,"totalLines":14}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01BDc7qBSx9s7VbDJKaSH3k3","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
